<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 94 WITHOUT LOSS V PAKISTAN AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 94 WITHOUT LOSS V PAKISTAN AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 94 without loss at lunch on the first day of the second and final test match against Pakistan in Colombo on Saturday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka: 94 without loss (S.Jayasuriya 71 n.o., R.Arnold 22 n.o.)</p>
